# Glossary

Terms appear here when a reader meets them on more than one path. Canonical
behavior stays in [reference](/docs/reference/).

| Term | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| Component | A PascalCase `@component` that lowers to a pure Roc `Html` function. |
| Standalone app | A directory of `.rocci` modules with at most one process `@init` / `@context`, run by `rocci run <dir>` or `rocci run File.rocci`. |
| Custom app | A directory with authored `main.roc` that reuses `.rocci` modules. |
| Fragment | Stable-target HTML from `@get:fragment` or a mutation `@method:fragment`; Datastar morphs it. |
| Command | A mutation `@method:command` whose `{}` body performs effects and returns no success representation. |
| Live | A path-bearing `@get:live` fragment stream; multiple streams may be declared per module. |
| Datastar | Browser transport for intent and morphing. Not a client application framework. |
| Fixture | `@fixture` preview data for `rocci view` / `browse`. |
| Test | Root-only `@test` boolean expression; `rocci test` runs it as Roc `expect`. |
| Lowering | Translating template regions to ordinary Roc (`Html.*`, camelCase functions). |
| Source map | Segments that map generated Roc back to `.rocci` spans. |
| Preview | The Tao/Wry window that loads the same local HTTP origin as a browser. |
| `rocci browse` | Component gallery. |
| Rocdown | Optional experimental document layer. Markdown-first pages that reuse templates and applications. |
| Loopback | `127.0.0.1` / `localhost` only in `rocci.toml` `[http].host`. |
| `??` default | Experimental field default in `.rocci` params; generated as a Roc type-position default, not a pattern. |

**Related:** [The stack](/docs/the-stack/) for composition terms.
